WEBVTT

00:01:54.149 --> 00:02:01.149
(Music)

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.566
I'm Adam Grant and this is WorkLife,
my podcast with TED.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:07.736
I'm an organizational psychologist.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.516
I study how to make work not suck.

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:11.691
In this show,

00:02:11.715 --> 00:02:14.879
I'm inviting myself inside the minds
of some truly unusual people,

00:02:14.903 --> 00:02:18.141
because they've mastered something
I wish everyone knew about work.

00:02:18.165 --> 00:02:21.646
(Music)

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.826
Today, procrastination,

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:26.476
and why it's not as much
of a character flaw

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.535
or as impossible to
overcome as you might think.

00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:31.750
(Music)